      "content": "wait, why would we need a shadow deployment for this? if we're moving the logic to lambdas, it's basically just code migration. plus, i'm looking at the delta and the lambdas won't be able to handle the complex error correction or the real-time optimization decisions you do. wouldn't the pipeline degrade if we just strip everything back to basic scripts? it feels like we'll end up spending more on troubleshooting later if we lose the intelligence layer.",
